---
const phone = "720-605-7678";
---

<footer class="bg-eden-navy px-6 py-10 text-white">
	<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
		<div>
			<p class="text-lg font-semibold">Eden Health Club</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/75">
				5990 S University Blvd<br />
				Greenwood Village, CO 80121
			</p>
			<a href="tel:+17206057678" class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-white underline underline-offset-4">
				{phone}
			</a>
		</div>
		<div class="text-sm text-white/70">
			<p>© 2026 Eden Wellness, LLC. All Rights Reserved.</p>
			<p class="mt-3">
				<a
					href="/paid-privacy/"
					rel="nofollow"
					class="hover:text-white"
				>
					Privacy Policy
				</a>
				<span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
				<a
					href="/paid-terms/"
					rel="nofollow"
					class="hover:text-white"
				>
					Terms
				</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-6xl border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs leading-6 text-white/55">
		Eden Health Club services are provided through licensed healthcare providers. Treatment plans are individualized based on medical evaluation. General health and wellness information is not a substitute for professional medical advice.
	</p>
</footer>
